  "decisions": [
    "Use ppproperty_supported for each nonempty attrs/hooks-free anonymous group. This shares the existing finite visibility/static/final/readonly/setter domain and invalid-declaration errors instead of maintaining a second flag list. Type/default preparation and publication/source authority are unchanged.",
